Global vars: instead of a Hash table,
use something else, as a hash table in all its mighty,
is still slow when dealing with something like lookups, 
and since when dealing with variables, there is a lot of lookups, it can
become really slow.
    IDEA: use an flat array instead. Lookups is a simple as an indexing. Constant time.

